00:42.743 --> 00:43.843
Why did we come here?

00:43.844 --> 00:45.611
Peter, just set up our blanket.

00:45.612 --> 00:46.979
I got to put on my swimsuit

00:46.980 --> 00:48.814
that's a one-piece
that turns into shorts.

00:48.815 --> 00:50.216
Once you hit a certain age,

00:50.217 --> 00:52.385
