01:08.769 --> 01:10.469
<i>- LOIS: What?
- Never mind.</i>

01:10.470 --> 01:13.105
Maybe we go back
under that boardwalk, hmm?

01:13.106 --> 01:14.640
What, right now?

01:14.641 --> 01:15.875
Yeah, why not?

01:15.876 --> 01:17.877
Let's sneak away from the kids
and go get busy.

01:17.878 --> 01:19.545
Oh, I'd love to, Peter,

01:19.546 --> 01:22.448
