01:38.432 --> 01:41.167
(EMOTIONAL):
Those ladies are really mean.

01:41.168 --> 01:44.403
Come on, Brian. I'm gonna make
you a YouTube surfin' dog.

01:44.404 --> 01:46.339
You know, one of those videos
where you can't tell

01:46.340 --> 01:47.907
