01:49.843 --> 01:52.245
- (FLATLY): I love it.
- (FLATLY): I hate it.

01:53.814 --> 01:55.548
<i>ANNOUNCER: Previously on</i> Big Brother,

01:55.549 --> 01:57.216
<i>Tanner became Head of Household,</i>

01:57.217 --> 01:59.218
