02:23.510 --> 02:25.177
<i>Who will be evicted tonight?</i>

02:25.178 --> 02:27.780
<i>Will Julie's
craven opportunism ever end?</i>

02:27.781 --> 02:29.448
<i>And what does it actually mean</i>

02:29.449 --> 02:31.917
<i>to have an employee "on call" for oral?</i>

02:31.918 --> 02:34.053
