02:37.624 --> 02:39.291
Hey. Sup?

02:39.292 --> 02:40.794
Hey.

02:42.429 --> 02:44.764
Okay, I'll give you one,
but don't tell your friends.

02:44.765 --> 02:46.533
Oh, yeah, yeah. No.

02:47.868 --> 02:49.770
