- (SIGHS)

02:50.704 --> 02:52.405
Okay, Lois, the kids are gone.

02:52.406 --> 02:55.408
Let's sneak under the boardwalk
and have sandy relations.

02:55.409 --> 02:57.009
I don't know, Peter.

02:57.010 --> 02:58.678
Come on. I am so ready.

02:58.679 --> 03:00.846
I snarfed a bunch of oysters
from over there,

03:00.847 --> 03:02.381
where the foam is super yellow.

03:02.382 --> 03:04.216
