03:22.469 --> 03:24.236
See you in 45 minutes.

03:24.237 --> 03:26.440
(WAVES CRASHING)

03:38.118 --> 03:40.620
- (WIND BLOWING)
- Ah, damn it!

03:44.624 --> 03:47.526
So, what should we do now that
we're finally down here?

03:47.527 --> 03:49.195
How 'bout we do something
that ain't been done

03:49.196 --> 03:51.464
