03:51.465 --> 03:53.733
have heterosexual sex.

03:53.734 --> 03:55.736
(MOANING)

03:57.370 --> 04:00.906
So, a strange man is changing
Stewie on our blanket.

04:00.907 --> 04:02.641
STEWIE: Hey, mind your business, Brian!

04:02.642 --> 04:03.877
