04:19.659 --> 04:23.662
Hey, Lois, I know we ain't under
the boardwalk no more, but

04:23.663 --> 04:26.232
(QUIETLY): you and me got
unfinished business.

04:26.233 --> 04:28.501
- Wha?
- Come here, you.

04:28.502 --> 04:31.103
(MOANING)

04:31.104 --> 04:33.038
