04:33.039 --> 04:35.007
What the hell? Wh-What is that?

04:35.008 --> 04:38.477
It... sounds like a happy family
dishwashing scene?

04:38.478 --> 04:41.547
Aw, crap, it's a happy family
dishwashing scene.

04:41.548 --> 04:44.650
Yay! We make a good team, clearly!

04:44.651 --> 04:46.352
We work to upbeat music.

04:46.353 --> 04:48.154
That means we're compatible.

04:48.155 --> 04:49.789
They even let the dog pitch in!

04:49.790 --> 04:51.056
How likable!

04:51.057 --> 04:52.792
And the baby thinks he's helping!

04:52.793 --> 04:54.627
