filmed separately, though.

04:54.628 --> 04:56.729
Notice he's just an insert shot.

04:56.730 --> 04:58.130
- Turn that music off.
- (MUSIC STOPS)

04:58.131 --> 04:59.732
And get the kitchen out
of the living room.

04:59.733 --> 05:03.002
Damn it! What do we got to do
to get some time to ourselves?

05:03.003 --> 05:04.737
Amen. Honestly...

05:04.738 --> 05:06.238
BOTH: You guys are more frustrating

05:06.239 --> 05:08.808
than trying to sell men's suits
in Australia.

05:08.809 --> 05:10.309
