05:21.955 --> 05:24.223
Thank God.

05:24.224 --> 05:25.624
(AUSTRALIAN ACCENT):
So, what do you think?

05:25.625 --> 05:27.126
Uh, they're a little long in the leg.

05:27.127 --> 05:29.028
Can you make 'em shorts,
cut off the sleeves,

05:29.029 --> 05:30.529
and make the shirt say "Billabong"?

05:30.530 --> 05:32.198
- Uh, sure.
- Thanks, mate.

05:32.199 --> 05:34.733
I really want people
to see my snow-white back hair

05:34.734 --> 05:36.369
