05:38.572 --> 05:40.506
Wh-What are we doing here?

05:40.507 --> 05:42.708
Yeah, I-I don't know. This is weird.

05:42.709 --> 05:44.910
- Would you like a belt?
- Eh, I'll take two.

05:44.911 --> 05:47.346
