09:10.617 --> 09:13.152
Oh, I get those mostly in the morning.

09:13.153 --> 09:14.820
You and me both, buddy.

09:14.821 --> 09:16.588
Again, an insert shot.

09:16.589 --> 09:19.959
We really had a hard time
syncing our schedules this week.

09:23.329 --> 09:25.364
Ah, this is wonderful, Peter.

09:25.365 --> 09:28.367
It-It's like a honeymoon in
CutawayLand, away from our kids.

09:28.368 --> 09:30.436
Yep. Next stop, Paris.

09:30.437 --> 09:32.504
Aw, crap, we picked the wrong line.

09:32.505 --> 09:33.772
May I have your name, please?

09:33.773 --> 09:35.407
Robert Loggia.

09:35.408 --> 09:36.642
Can you spell that for me?

09:36.643 --> 09:39.278
Certainly. That's "Robert Loggia."

09:39.279 --> 09:41.947
"R" as in "Robert Loggia."

09:41.948 --> 09:45.584
